                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="KRIJGRL"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                    text="&lt;ol>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>SKYRIZI &lt;a href=&quot;https://ec.europa.eu/health/documents/community-register/2019/20190426144462/anx_144462_nl.pdf&quot;>SmPC&lt;/a>.&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Le Berre, C. et al. (2023). “Ulcerative Colitis.” &lt;i>Lancet. &lt;/i>402(10401):571-584. doi: https://doi.org/10.1016/S0140-6736(23)00966-2&lt;i> &lt;/i>&amp;nbsp;&lt;i>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Crohn &amp;amp; Colitis NL &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crohn-colitis.nl/over-crohn-colitis/wat-is-colitis-ulcerosa/&quot;>Wat is colitis ulcerosa? - Crohn en Colitis NL (crohn-colitis.nl)&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases. “Ulcerative Colitis.” https://www.niddk.nih.gov/health-information/digestive-diseases/ulcerative-colitis/all-content. Updated September 2020. Accessed July 15, 2024.&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Rapport, F. et al. (2019). “Patient Views About the Impact of Ulcerative Colitis and Its Management With Drug Treatment and Surgery: A Nested Qualitative Study Within the CONSTRUCT Trial&lt;i>.&lt;/i>”&lt;i> BMC Gastroenterol.&lt;/i> 19(1):166.&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Duvallet, E. et al. (2011). “Interleukin-23: A Key Cytokine in Inflammatory Diseases.” &lt;i>Ann Med.&lt;/i> 43(7):503-511. doi:10.3109/07853890.2011.577093.&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Moschen, A.R. et al. (2019). “IL-12, IL-23 and IL-17 in IBD: Immunobiology and Therapeutic Targeting.” &lt;i>Nat Rev Gastroenterol Hepatol.&lt;/i> 16(3):185-196. doi:10.1038/s41575-018-0084-8.&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ol>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                    textIsRich="true"/>
                            </container>
